1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:04,080
(Gablehauser:)Dr. Koothrappali, have you ever had lunch
in the president's dining room?

2
00:00:04,245 --> 00:00:06,745
(Raj:)I didn't even know
there was a president's dining room.

3
00:00:06,915 --> 00:00:09,505
(Gablehauser:)It's the same food as the cafeteria,
only fresh.

4
00:00:09,667 --> 00:00:11,757
(Gablehauser:)- Come on, little buddy.
- Okay, big buddy.

5
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:13,840
(Raj:)See you tonight, guys.

6
00:00:16,633 --> 00:00:19,133
- You can stop smiling now.
- Ah.

7
00:00:21,596 --> 00:00:24,136
(Raj:)So anyway, after a fantastic lunch...

8
00:00:24,307 --> 00:00:26,767
(Raj:)...I was whisked off
to the People magazine photo shoot...

9
00:00:26,935 --> 00:00:28,935
- Have any of you been to a photo shoot?
HOWARD: No.

10
00:00:29,103 --> 00:00:30,893
(Raj:)It's fantastic.

11
00:00:31,272 --> 00:00:34,812
(Raj:)Apparently, the camera loves me,
and I it.

12
00:00:35,568 --> 00:00:40,658
(Raj:)They shot me in front of a starry
background where I posed like this:

13
00:00:45,537 --> 00:00:47,497
(Raj:)They're going to digitally add
a supernova.

14
00:00:47,664 --> 00:00:50,664
(Raj:)They say it's the perfect metaphor
for my incandescent talent.

15
00:00:50,833 --> 00:00:55,883
(Sheldon:)Right, a ball of hot, flaming gas
that collapses upon itself.

16
00:00:56,422 --> 00:00:57,462
[CELL PHONE RINGS]

